            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 2067,
            "text": "{\"task_id\":\"80b7e5f5-3482-4311-a17f-8da4a69675c4\",\"metadata\":{\"prompt\":\"The cat from the reference image walks across a sunlit wooden floor.\",\"model_prompt\":\"subject_definitions:\\n<Subject 1> is the white cat with thick white fur, erect pointed ears, a pink nose, and heterochromia iridum with one blue eye and one amber-yellow eye, shown in <Picture 1>.\\n\\nsummary:\\n[keyframe completion] The target video features <Subject 1> walking forward across a sunlit wooden floor.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the white cat's thick white fur, erect pointed ears, pink nose, and heterochromia iridum with one blue eye and one amber-yellow eye are retained.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a medium-wide shot opens with <Subject 1>, the white cat with thick white fur, erect pointed ears, a pink nose, and heterochromia iridum with one blue eye and one amber-yellow eye, positioned on a polished wooden floor in a sunlit room. The camera tracks forward with small amplitude at slow speed as the cat lifts its front right paw, steps forward onto the planks, and lowers its head into a steady walking stride. Sunlight streams diagonally across the grain of the wooden floor, illuminating floating dust motes as the cat continues its movement toward the foreground.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nSoft, rhythmic paw steps on polished wood accompany a quiet indoor ambience.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nN/A\",\"prompt_expansion_elapsed_ms\":2666,\"prompt_enhancement_level\":null,\"model\":\"MiniMax-H3\",\"task_type\":\"R2V\",\"seed\":296065,\"fps\":null,\"height\":480,\"width\":864,\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\",\"resolution_label\":null,\"duration_secs\":1.0,\"num_frames\":null,\"src_image_urls\":[\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/justintanner/apicity/d885599410f0a904c1d78ab74019e6a5fa97f00e/tests/fixtures/cat2.jpg\"],\"input_video_secs\":null,\"src_video_urls\":null,\"src_audio_urls\":null,\